The Banana Pi R2 is a router based development board, which can run on a variety of open source operating systems including OpenWrt, Android, and Bananian. It has 4 Gigabit LAN ports, 1 Gigabit WAN


<WRAP BOX>
  * MediaTek MT7623N, Quad-core ARM Cortex-A7
  * Mali 450 MP4 GPU
  * 2G DDR3 SDRAM
  * 1x Mini PCIE interface
  * 2x SATA interface
  * 4x Gigabit LAN 1x Gigabit WAN
</WRAP>

